  "description": "Coin logos (CoinGecko, gaps filled from the Binance symbol list) (Android CoinLogos.kt / iOS CoinLogos.swift): symbol normalisation, initials for the fallback circle, allowed image hosts (no «missing_» placeholders), the small image variant, markets with logos (never for DEX pools), file names and the CoinGecko ranking -> symbol map (first occurrence wins). TradFi pairs (stocks, commodities) never use CoinGecko: tradFi builds their logos from the Binance list (tokenised stock «NVDAB» with tag bStocks first, then futures-only entries, then names CoinGecko does not know, never via multiplier prefixes), keys «TRADFI:NVDA», files «T_NVDA.png». Names (cleanName, pickNames, tradFi.expectedNames): «NVIDIA bStocks» → «NVIDIA», name equal to the ticker dropped, at most 40 characters (39 + «…»).",
